{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":503713,"name":"Lashawn Martin","username":"Lashawn_Martin","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/57b2e6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-29T20:06:45.631Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve got 1Password connected and logins in the “Shared with Grok Bot” vault. Connect finds the Instagram item fine. When Grok Bot autofills on its own computer/browser, the fill card shows Filled (even reported fill+submit once), but only the username lands. Password field stays empty, Log In stays disabled.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame false-success thing showsup on every site. The vault password itself is fine — works when I sign in manually / on my Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBasically bots can’t finish logins without me babysitting the Mac, which kind of kills the point of Shared with Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect 1Password to Grok Bot and put Instagram (and Letterboxd) login in Shared with Grok Bot vault.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Grok Bot’s computer, open \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTrigger Shared 1Password Connect autofill for that page.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch the fill card say Filled.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck the form: username is filled, password is still empty, Log In stays disabled. Instagram may show incorrect login. Same pattern on Letterboxd.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnect should fill BOTH username and password (or clearly fail). A Filled success should mean the password field actually has a value so the bot can sign in without me on the Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503713-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503713-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/c7bajc0e8tsvNbZowRFVFtZarVM.png?dl=1\" title=\"image.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_687x500.png\" alt=\"image.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"c7bajc0e8tsvNbZowRFVFtZarVM\" width=\"687\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_687x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_1030x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/4/54e9de1330c637c25dac84bbe7d40f801589fa0a_2_1374x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E8E8E7\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003